## task-operator.soar -- selection-world: 1 compare.

## Preference for evaluate-operator look-ahead.
sp {selection-world*compare*evaluate-operator*look-ahead
   :default
   (state <s> ^look-ahead-operator <operator>
              ^untried-tied-operator <operator>)
   -->
   (<s> ^operator <operator> !)}   # makes learning with add-osk on more general - # might cause problems in some cases.
